            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>數據狗(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:DDOG:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/DDOG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">DDOG-US</a>)截至台北時間15日01:23股價上漲11.09美元，報232.30美元，漲幅5.01%，成交量1,329,877（股），盤中最高價232.34美元、最低價220.72美元。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美股指數盤中表現</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>：-0.15%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數：-0.24%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">NASDAQ</a>指數：-0.14%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費城半導體</a>指數：-5.09%</li></ul></section><section><p><em>數據狗(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:DDOG:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/DDOG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">DDOG-US</a>)歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>近 1 週：+3.89%</li> <li>近 1 月：-12.3%</li> <li>近 3 月：-3.78%</li> <li>近 6 月：+77.65%</li> <li>今年以來：+62.67%</li></ul></section></main>",
